0 Snapgate — a spring memory switch
0 Name: snapgate.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/snapgate.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; one medium angular motor on port A.
0 // Stock 24:1 worm shifts a real 9L shock anchor; the passive rocker snaps between roller stops.
0 // Install one intact complete 9L shock. The 2909 and 2910 entries are its two moving CAD components.
0 // Factory coil included in that shock. Render-only formed coil and native spring law add no purchased pieces.
0 // Experimental model: see separate native, source-mesh, and physical-build qualification records.
0 // No artificial joints, invisible guides, authored animation, or prescribed output trajectory.
